{{disambig msg|the Afterbirth † content updates|the passive item|Booster Pack (Item)}}
'''Booster Packs''' were recurring content updates for ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth †]]''. Booster Packs contained popular community-developed mods as updates in the game continued to add features.

== Booster Pack #{{anchor|1}} ==
The first Booster Pack was released on March 23, 2017 on PC, and contains 9 new items, 3 new trinkets, and 3 new special cards, along with some new features.<ref>[[boisite:158765831809|Booster Tutor!]]</ref>

=== Active Items ===
{{collectible table | Black Hole, Mystery Gift, Sprinkler }}

=== Passive Items ===
{{collectible table | Angry Fly, Bozo, Broken Modem, Buddy in a Box, Fast Bombs, Lil Delirium }}

=== Trinkets ===
{{trinket table | Hairpin, Wooden Cross, Butter! }}

=== Cards ===
{{pickup table | Huge Growth, Ancient Recall, Era Walk }}

=== Other Features ===
* [[Dice Room]]s now have a small icon in the corner of the room that denotes what the effect of the room is, inspired by [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=835149267 this Steam Workshop mod].
* Added a new option in the menu to display charge bars, based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=835177566 this Steam Workshop mod].
* Added 5 new {{c|Eden}} hairstyles, based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=834446972 this Steam Workshop mod].

== Booster Pack #{{anchor|2}} ==
The second Booster Pack was released on May 12, 2017 on PC, and contains 6 new items, 1 new trinket, and miscellaneous changes.<ref>[[boisite:160602152274|Booster Rooster #2!]]</ref>

=== Active Items ===
{{collectible table | Coupon, Telekinesis, Moving Box }}

=== Passive Items ===
{{collectible table | Jumper Cables, Leprosy, Technology Zero }}

=== Trinkets ===
{{trinket table | Filigree Feather }}

=== Other Features ===
* {{r|Angel Room}}s were rebalanced - they contain more items but only a single one can be collected.
* Mods no longer disable achievements after beating {{e|Mom}} once. This includes the use of the [[Debug Console]].
* Active items now charge during {{r|Challenge Room}} waves.
* Multiple items that affect the appearance of bombs now stack visually, based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=854593270 this Steam Workshop mod].
* {{i|Jar of Flies}} now changes appearance depending on how many flies are in the jar, based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=840463618 this Steam Workshop mod].
* Added {{m|Mom's Dressing Table}}, which changes Isaac's appearance to only reflect a few of his items, based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=859294029 this Steam Workshop mod].
* Added the {{tf|Stompy}} transformation.

== Booster Pack #{{anchor|3}} ==
The third Booster Pack was released on June 30, 2017, for the PC, and contains 4 new items, and 1 trinket.

=== Active Items ===
{{collectible table | Mr. ME! }}

=== Passive Items ===
{{collectible table | 7 Seals, Angelic Prism, Pop! }}

=== Trinkets ===
{{trinket table | Door Stop }}

=== Other Features ===
* Added new {{c|Eden}} hairstyles, based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=889949830 this Steam Workshop mod].

== Booster Pack #{{anchor|4}} ==
The fourth Booster Pack was released on October 10, 2017 and contains 5 new items, 1 new trinket, and 6 new enemies.<ref>[[boisite:166309298439|Booster Pack 4 You!]]</ref>

=== Passive Items ===
{{collectible table | Death's List, Haemolacria, Lachryphagy, Schoolbag, Trisagion }}

=== Trinkets ===
{{trinket table | Extension Cord }}

=== Monsters ===
{{entity table | Cross Stone Shooter, Fistuloid, Gush, Soul Sucker, Tar Boy, Tube Worm }}

=== Other Features ===
* Most items from previous Booster Packs have new and improved graphics.
** {{i|Broken Modem}} collectible sprite was changed.
** {{i|Technology Zero}} collectible and costume sprites were changed.
** {{i|Angry Fly}} collectible and familiar sprites were changed.
** {{i|Sprinkler}} collectible and entity sprites were changed.
** {{i|7 Seals}} collectible and familiar sprites were changed. Familiar sprites were based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1098300666 this Steam Workshop mod] by Quartz.
** {{i|Pop!}} collectible sprite was changed.
** {{t|Hairpin}} trinket sprite was changed.
** {{t|Butter!}} trinket sprite was changed.
** {{t|Door Stop}} trinket sprite was changed.
* Added 400 new rooms to better integrate the Afterbirth+ enemies (including Booster Pack #4 enemies) into the game.

== Booster Pack #{{anchor|5}} ==
The fifth and last Booster Pack was released on April 30, 2018 and contains 1 new character, 18 new items, 3 new trinkets, 7 new enemies, and a new boss.<ref>[[boisite:173459905199|The Forgotten Booster!]]</ref>

=== Characters ===
[[The Forgotten]] is a new character added in the Booster pack.

=== Active Items ===
{{collectible table | Book of the Dead, Broken Shovel 1, Mom's Shovel, Sacrificial Altar }}

=== Passive Items ===
{{collectible table | Blanket, Brittle Bones, Broken Shovel 2, Dad's Ring, Divorce Papers, Flat Stone, Hallowed Ground, Jaw Bone, Lil Spewer, Marbles, Marrow, Mystery Egg, Pointy Rib, Slipped Rib }}

=== Trinkets ===
{{trinket table | Rotten Penny, Baby-Bender, Finger Bone }}

