=== Other features ===
* {{e|Bone Heart}}s, a new heart-type.
* {{e|Golden Bomb}}s now have a pickup sound effect.
* {{e|Black Heart}}s now have a pickup sound effect.
* {{e|White Poop}}, a new poop type.
* {{e|Gaping Maw}}s supposedly have a chance to become {{e|Broken Gaping Maw}}s, although this never actually happens ingame.<ref name="brokenmaw">[https://twitter.com/edmundmcmillen/status/972008259266650112 ''"i believe more broken maw rooms were added and possibly the chance for normal ones to become broken ones"'']</ref>
* Changes to {{mode|greed}} [[Greed]] mode {{r|Angel Room}}s.
* Added 817 new rooms.
* New charge bar graphics.
* New and improved graphics based on [https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1158478342 this Steam Workshop mod].
* New and improved graphics for burrowing monsters based on [https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1201700604 this Steam Workshop mod].
* Added the unlocks from the Switch version of the game.
* Added 64 new achievements, including 36 from the Switch version.
* Added 43 new [[Babies|Co-op Babies]], 41 being cosmetic and two unlockables (Bone Baby and Bound Baby).
* Other items received new and improved graphics.
