== Trivia ==
* Booster Pack 3 is the only booster pack to not be featured on a blog post.
* The developers of [[anti:|Antibirth]] helped create booster packs 4 and 5.
* Many of the added [[Babies|Co-op Babies]] from Booster Pack 5 are references to popular mods that were never added in the Booster Packs.

